PebbleFace", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "642d389224e0675666865d19f6608c4d4c8f5e10", "message": "Update README.md", "created_at": "2015-08-13T12:00:21Z", "repo": "PebbleFace", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "eaad7528ef5562d8f7a86e33917db0fa2a678b17", "message": "Update README.md", "created_at": "2015-08-13T12:00:04Z", "repo": "PebbleFace", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "1f0f29124bfa6d0fff45e4b5718e3fce6fa72ffa", "message": "Update README.md", "created_at": "2015-08-13T11:59:30Z", "repo": "PebbleFace", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "6cd7513547571c179e0c720ca2c4aaecf8b21b66", "message": "IMAGE!", "created_at": "2015-08-13T11:57:31Z", "repo": "PebbleFace", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "5a0847c345ef710dfc0abc57011bd35878ffb733", "message": "Now with weather icons\n\nSourced from TimeStyle: \nhttps://github.com/freakified/TimeStylePebble/", "created_at": "2015-08-13T11:54:50Z", "repo": "PebbleFace", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "69c39c0da317eca1cfa9cb0fb14cbe96448bee62", "message": "Build fix, font change, calendar square", "created_at": "2015-08-11T12:16:36Z", "repo": "PebbleFace", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "a9f7d3b31583b069b0a86def0a90515413cee664", "message": "Date renders, bold bugs fixed, prep bug fixed\n\nrectangle for calendar stuff started", "created_at": "2015-08-06T11:38:30Z", "repo": "PebbleFace", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "4dd810725ac023ebeaeb9bfa9068c94f01291d12", "message": "I done broke it\n\nStarting to get calendar information too, but I'm having initial troubles from quick setup", "created_at": "2015-07-30T11:15:46Z", "repo": "PebbleFace", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "6043c1246c35879ebb783b1368839e075d93d656", "message": "Now with weather!\n\nGets weather information from Sydney (I don't care for getting precise location its all the same)\nFormats code a little", "created_at": "2015-07-30T10:43:47Z", "repo": "PebbleFace", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "2d17deca398ff7ed693d554c334180122dea45e7", "message": "Adds initial weather stuff", "created_at": "2015-07-29T03:47:57Z", "repo": "PebbleFace", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "bbb33beacbe459730b6a28bfdc06e741f1e28dad", "message": "bugfixes around task setting incorrect and time\n\nPrep time kept coming up when it shouldn't!\nChanged \"FREE TIME\" to \"FREEDOM\"\nAdded default image\nHopefully fixed time issue where \"TEN O' TEN\"\nChanged buffer length of the \"o'\" for \"o'clock\"", "created_at": "2015-07-28T11:52:00Z", "repo": "PebbleFace", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "046fa30356d8b18bf66da29f1420e7c6072064e8", "message": "Now with compilation!\n\nFixed bad code which prevented rendering the hour string", "created_at": "2015-07-25T07:25:36Z", "repo": "PebbleFace", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "ff1e2204c7cb6b7c9e1a3485dccc0804711341bc", "message": "Pointers, proper unloading, removal of fonts\n\nIncreased efficiency through not declaring variables every time and just pointing\nRemoved annoying problem where watch couldn't unload fonts\nCannot run on watch but can run on emulator", "created_at": "2015-07-25T07:17:15Z", "repo": "PebbleFace", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "3917d096c8a5b73cb8df6ff7f12ff5d81eee8ae1", "message": "X twenty five + const changes\n\n\"five past\" could not fit on a line. Rather than compromise on font size, I've changed the woring to \"X twenty five\" which is still a colloquialism.\n\nI've also set all variables that are static to global constants so that they aren't declared every minute, killing the watch\n\nFinally, I now check whether or not the time has already been set before changing it. Preventing constant rendering every minute (Sinve this updates every 5)\n\nOoh also, watch now vibrates on task change", "created_at": "2015-07-19T05:26:34Z", "repo": "PebbleFace", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "f26bb0a6efcabdc99e9096f8894be3a3dbdedaad", "message": "Does not update time if already same value\n\nNot sure of the efficiencies of doing this. Declaring more variables versus running an operation every minute. Pebble may already check if a value si set before updating it without telling me", "created_at": "2015-07-12T09:13:25Z", "repo": "PebbleFace", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "60c7eb568461aa3a8a2fe11e9867e9a4598ab753", "message": "Methods in wrong order\n\nI sometimes forget that I need to have the methods declared before you use them with pebble dev", "created_at": "2015-07-11T23:38:05Z", "repo": "PebbleFace", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "210b6f1d7618a229d55b974900f04a74ade12a1e", "message": "DONE BROKE IT!\n\nCan't seem to run this. However I've done code to change GRect colors based on time and furhter split code into smaller parts.\n\nHave the API access from NSW travel Auth, so will integrate that soon", "created_at": "2015-07-11T09:30:34Z", "repo": "PebbleFace", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "7d53455b01420b74e97dce44df4dbf0947dd254a", "message": "Font change. Time calculation changes", "created_at": "2015-07-09T00:49:05Z", "repo": "PebbleFace", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "07add186b7888b084a33e0538377bb1a4b94ded4", "message": "Font changes, background chages, text changes", "created_at": "2015-07-08T03:13:13Z", "repo": "PebbleFace", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "a25e197b0ce09699f3380a0dfd45ab5859676cb0", "message": "Minor text changes", "created_at": "2015-07-07T03:36:04Z", "repo": "PebbleFace", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "ae6a7fff796e19fc4a4453a7d22d71cb2e6d1c1a", "message": "COMPILES YAY. NEW FONT YAY", "created_at": "2015-07-07T02:34:17Z", "repo": "PebbleFace", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "b091865578ee5683a9adf539a97802b1343b1e7f", "message": "HMM INTERESTING!\n\nGetting a strange error in that I cannot install the app since making a function to return a char. Will investigate soon.\n\nOtherwise, changes include\n- Three new text layers\n- Calculation of hours, days, minutes ints in their own methods\n- Moving towards cool text based time instead of lame-ass digital numbers", "created_at": "2015-07-06T11:39:43Z", "repo": "PebbleFace", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "80e95d447bfd1d78e94441c2be744b8573371bed", "message": "Changes messaging depending on what time it is\n\nNow accuratlye checks what the hour is, then display different messaging between those times", "created_at": "2015-07-06T00:24:36Z", "repo": "PebbleFace", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "6fdfff29392913a5816bf568f9a621cd3fd92318", "message": "Changes messaging depending on what time it is", "created_at": "2015-07-06T00:00:12Z", "repo": "PebbleFace", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "a7fa4794fc89577029214fbbf566368a000ed39e", "message": "Reorganising some code\n\nNot much of a commit, but I wanted to separate things out a little more", "created_at": "2015-07-02T12:50:53Z", "repo": "PebbleFace", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "71fec0997176043fd7